To use this flowchart, simply start at the "Start" node and follow the arrows to each subsequent step. If the bread is not fully soaked in the egg mixture, go back to step 2 and repeat. If one side of the bread is not fully cooked, go back to step 4 and cook the other side. Once both sides are cooked, move on to step 6 and serve with your desired toppings. Finally, end at the "Stop" node.

