How can I retrieve PersonX's workplace information using PHP and the given database schema?
Here is the PHP code that can be used:
<?php
//establish connection to the database
$conn = mysqli_connect("localhost", "username", "password", "database_name");
//query to retrieve PersonX's workplace information
$query = "SELECT w.Name, w.Location
          FROM Workplaces w
          JOIN Persons p ON w.ID = p.WorkplaceID
          WHERE p.Name = 'PersonX'";
//execute the query and store the result
$result = mysqli_query($conn, $query);
//display the result in a table
echo "<table>";
echo "<tr><th>Name</th><th>Location</th></tr>";
while($row = mysqli_fetch_assoc($result)) {
    echo "<tr><td>".$row['Name']."</td><td>".$row['Location']."</td></tr>";
}
echo "</table>";
//close the database connection
mysqli_close($conn);
?>
This code will retrieve the workplace name and location for PersonX from the given database schema and display it in a table.

