```
This CSS code uses flexbox to create a responsive layout for the gallery, and sets the `width`, `height`, `margin`, and `max-width` properties of the `img` elements to adjust their size and spacing. The `@media` queries adjust the `max-width` property of the `img` elements based on the size of the screen, to optimize the layout for different screen sizes.

